OL,3,GNEWSAWigan prepares to say goodbye to
OL,4,ASir Billy Boston
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe funeral of rugby league legend Sir
OL,7,FBilly Boston will take place later.
OL,9,FBoston, who was the first player in
OL,10,Frugby league's 130-year history to
OL,11,Freceive a knighthood, died last month
OL,12,Faged 92.
OL,14,FHis funeral will take place at Wigan
OL,15,FWarriors' Brick Community Stadium at
OL,16,F12:30 BST, with a limited number of
OL,17,Fsupporters able to attend.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
