OL,3,GNEWSAWigan prepares to say goodbye to
OL,4,ASir Billy Boston
OL,5,
OL,6,FBefore the service, a cortege will
OL,7,Ftravel through Wigan and arrive at the
OL,8,Fstadium. The West Stand will be open as
OL,9,FSir Billy makes his final journey
OL,10,Fthrough the Stadium Tunnel. A private
OL,11,Fburial will follow.
